  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VlUKoW1.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CObIsOp.png\" alt=\"Food Showcase1\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DPSnfiT.png\" alt=\"Block Showcase1\"></p>\n<p>此非官方相容套件確保 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hearth-and-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hearth and Harvest</a> 模組的紋理能與出色的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 資源包完美整合。</p>\n<p><strong>功能：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>讓農業看起來更豐盛且動態的3D作物</li>\n<li>部分功能性方塊升級了簡單3D細節</li>\n<li>一致的視覺風格，匹配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur-farmers-delight-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur Farmer’s Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>感謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maffhew – Excalibur 的創作者</li>\n<li>AlabasterLeking – Hearth and Harvest 的創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TC</a> – 以其 Excalibur Farmer's Delight 支援為基礎，本擴充套件依此開發</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Modrinth</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">歡迎將其加入任何模組包，請務必正確署名！🏰</span></p>",
